        <mxCell id="c95" value="&lt;b&gt;Dishpatch: tables and SQLAlchemy models&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;generated from src/data/sql/dishpatch.sql, 2026-10-23&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Header:&lt;/b&gt; table · Model class in src/app/models/&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lines:&lt;/b&gt; crow's foot = many, bar = exactly one, circle+bar = zero or one&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours:&lt;/b&gt; a line has the colour of the table it points to (&lt;font color='#4d8a2e'&gt;&lt;b&gt;restaurants&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color='#3a6db5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;people&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color='#8a5aa8'&gt;&lt;b&gt;cuisines&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color='#c07d00'&gt;&lt;b&gt;orders/dishes via order_items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;); dashed = optional or unused&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;One-to-one&lt;/b&gt; (a person): contacts ← profiles ← accounts ← users&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;treated as 1:1 by the code; the database doesn't enforce it (no UNIQUE)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;One-to-many:&lt;/b&gt; cuisine → restaurants, restaurant → menu_items,&lt;br&gt;restaurant → orders, user → orders (as customer, and as driver)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Many-to-many:&lt;/b&gt; orders ↔ menu_items, through &lt;b&gt;order_items&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(an association object: it also stores quantity and unit_price)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Grey = no model / not used by the API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• menus: not used yet; menu_items.menu_id is always NULL&lt;br&gt;• deliveries: leftover, no foreign keys&lt;br&gt;• file_loads: the ingester's load log" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1000" y="40" width="430" height="330" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
